WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:15.367
First, request Android access. Enter the Google account used on your TV. Complete verification if asked, then select Request access. Wait for approval before opening the tester invitation.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:23.433
An admin must approve your request. Please wait for your invitation email. It may arrive later, after approval.

00:00:23.884 --> 00:00:32.209
After approval, open the tester link with the Google account used on your TV. When you are a tester, select Download test app.

00:00:32.917 --> 00:00:38.717
Look for Watch TV App by Cru. Select Install, or Install on more devices.

00:00:39.417 --> 00:00:48.767
Choose your Android TV or Chromecast, then Install. In this recording, the Chromecast already has the app, so no new installation is needed.

00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:56.284
On your TV, open Apps, find Jesus Film Watch, and press the centre button. Wait for Home to load.